#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"We're sorry, but you are not authorized to use the {site_name} website. We "
"have found that some of the information you provided when registering on the"
" site is incorrect or that you have violated the rules of use of the site. "
"Therefore you are not authorized to use the site."
msgstr ""
"Maaf, Anda tidak diizinkan menggunakan situs web {site_name}. Kami menemukan"
" bahwa beberapa informasi yang Anda berikan saat mendaftar di situs tidak "
"benar atau Anda telah melanggar aturan penggunaan situs. Oleh karena itu "
"Anda tidak diperbolehkan menggunakan situs tersebut."

